{"id": "47451", "title": "我要我们在一起", "author": "蓝漾", "category": "玄幻魔法", "count": 34, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/47/47451.htm", "intro": "", "base": "files/article/html/47/47451", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "１、原来他是尹天蓝。", "file": "6424956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２、你认识安亦宸吗？", "file": "6424957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "３、“你真的是季晴朗？”", "file": "6424958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "４、不管是因为什么原因，他们都分手了不是吗。", "file": "6424959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "５、你就和天蓝合作吧。", "file": "6424960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "６、你会送我一份很棒的礼物吧？", "file": "6424961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "７、他好看的笑着：“晴朗，你真好！”", "file": "6424962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "８、“尹天蓝，你怎么会到我家来？”", "file": "6424963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "９、“对不起”，亦宸在她耳边轻轻地说。", "file": "6424964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１０、“我们交往吧！”", "file": "6424965.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１１、“以前错过了，现在不想再有遗憾。”", "file": "6424966.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１２、“天蓝，我一直都记得你。”", "file": "6424967.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１３、“晴朗，我觉得现在我很幸福。”", "file": "6424968.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１４、他看着楼下的他们，渐渐的眯了眼睛。", "file": "6424969.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１５、“为什么你总是晚了的那个？”", "file": "6424970.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１６、我想每天早晨都能这样看到你！", "file": "6424971.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１７、如果继续，我只要我们在一起！", "file": "6424972.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１８、弹首曲子给我好不好？", "file": "6424973.html", "available": false}, {"title": "１９、明天帮我办转学手续吧。", "file": "6424974.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２０、“你为我做的，我都知道。”", "file": "6424975.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２１、只有你在身边，我才安心。", "file": "6424976.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２２、“快点，下车。”", "file": "6424977.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２３、你的答案只能是我。", "file": "6424978.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２４、我想恨你，可是我却做不到。", "file": "6424979.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２５、晴朗，嫁给我。", "file": "6424980.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２６、我会一直在这里等你。", "file": "6424981.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２７、出车祸了！", "file": "6424982.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２８、他现在正在深度昏迷中……", "file": "6424983.html", "available": false}, {"title": "２９、左右为难。", "file": "6424984.html", "available": false}, {"title": "３０、天蓝终于醒了。", "file": "6424985.html", "available": false}, {"title": "３１、请你离开吧。", "file": "6424986.html", "available": false}, {"title": "３２、不要打季氏的主意！", "file": "6424987.html", "available": false}, {"title": "３３、我只是想再争取一次。", "file": "6424988.html", "available": false}, {"title": "３４、结局。喜欢和爱不一样。", "file": "6424989.html", "available": false}]}